    narr:narration """This narrative maps the core product architecture and delivery metrics around decision capture. It centers on the defining thesis of [capturing decisions at the moment of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), established in March 2026 as the product's primary differentiator. By August 2026, this architectural focus grounded concrete execution, documented through [shipping the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787995832331_1) and achieving a [quarterly high velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787995832331_2). Execution was further catalyzed by technical integrations, specifically noting that [the Zephyr integration was the key unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787995832331_3) for delivery performance under [sprint velocity and driving factors](narr:Position_AsyncDecisionWidgetSprintVelocity).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787995832331_1> ;
